{"seq":2,"slug":"dna-structure","title":"高一生物 — DNA结构与复制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/dna-structure","wordCount":2089,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一生物-dna结构与复制\">高一生物 — DNA结构与复制</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>1953年4月25日，沃森和克里克在《自然》杂志上发表了一篇仅一页的论文，提出了DNA双螺旋结构模型。这篇不到一千字的论文彻底改变了生物学的面貌——它不仅揭示了遗传信息的载体长什么样，还暗示了遗传信息如何被精确复制。DNA双螺旋就像一架扭曲的梯子，两条糖-磷酸骨架构成梯子的扶手，碱基配对构成梯子的横档。这个优雅的结构蕴含着生命遗传的全部密码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-dna-是主要的遗传物质\">一、DNA 是主要的遗传物质</h3><p><strong>证明 DNA 是遗传物质的经典实验</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>（一）肺炎链球菌转化实验（格里菲斯，1928年）</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组别</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>小鼠结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>①</td>\n<td>注射活的 R 型（无毒）</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>②</td>\n<td>注射活的 S 型（有毒）</td>\n<td>死亡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>③</td>\n<td>注射加热杀死的 S 型</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>④</td>\n<td>注射 R 型 + 加热杀死的 S 型</td>\n<td>死亡，体内分离出活的 S 型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论：加热杀死的 S 型菌中存在某种&quot;转化因子&quot;，能将 R 型菌转化为 S 型菌。</p>\n<p><strong>（二）艾弗里的体外转化实验（1944年）</strong></p>\n<p>艾弗里分别提取 S 型菌的各种成分，发现只有 DNA 能使 R 型菌转化为 S 型菌。用 DNA 酶处理后，转化能力消失。结论：<strong>DNA 是遗传物质</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>（三）噬菌体侵染实验（赫尔希和蔡斯，1952年）</strong></p>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>32</mn></msup><mtext>P</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{32}\\text{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span></span></span></span></span></span> 标记 DNA、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>35</mn></msup><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{35}\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">35</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span> 标记蛋白质外壳。结果发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>32</mn></msup><mtext>P</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{32}\\text{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入细菌细胞内并出现在子代噬菌体中，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>35</mn></msup><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{35}\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">35</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span> 留在细胞外。结论：DNA 是噬菌体的遗传物质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-dna-的化学组成\">二、DNA 的化学组成</h3><p>DNA（脱氧核糖核酸）由<strong>脱氧核苷酸</strong>组成。每个脱氧核苷酸包含三个部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磷酸基团</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>PO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_3\\text{PO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱氧核糖</td>\n<td>五碳糖（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_5\\text{H}_{10}\\text{O}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含氮碱基</td>\n<td>腺嘌呤（A）、鸟嘌呤（G）、胞嘧啶（C）、胸腺嘧啶（T）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DNA 有四种脱氧核苷酸，区别仅在于碱基不同。</p>\n<p><strong>核苷酸之间的连接</strong>：通过磷酸二酯键，一个核苷酸的磷酸基与下一个核苷酸的脱氧核糖之间脱水缩合，形成长链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-dna-双螺旋结构\">三、DNA 双螺旋结构</h3><p>沃森和克里克提出的 DNA 双螺旋模型的要点：</p>\n<p><strong>（一）整体结构</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>两条脱氧核苷酸链反向平行（一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27; \\to 3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，另一条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27; \\to 5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>围绕同一中心轴呈右手螺旋</li>\n<li>螺旋直径约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{ nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，每旋转一圈包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 对碱基，螺距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.4</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.4\\text{ nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nm</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（二）骨架</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>脱氧核糖和磷酸基团交替连接构成两条链的骨架（如梯子的扶手）</li>\n<li>骨架在外侧，碱基在内侧</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>（三）碱基互补配对</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A（腺嘌呤）与 T（胸腺嘧啶）配对，之间有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个氢键</li>\n<li>G（鸟嘌呤）与 C（胞嘧啶）配对，之间有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个氢键</li>\n<li>嘌呤（A、G）总与嘧啶（T、C）配对，保证了双螺旋直径的均一性</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>碱基互补配对原则的数学推论（查加夫规则）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = T, \\quad G = C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>嘌呤总数 = 嘧啶总数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + G = T + C \\quad (\\text{嘌呤总数 = 嘧啶总数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">嘌呤总数</span><span class=\"mord\"> = </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">嘧啶总数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> 的比值因物种而异，是 DNA 的特征值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A + T}{G + C} \\text{ 的比值因物种而异，是 DNA 的特征值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的比值因物种而异，是</span><span class=\"mord\"> DNA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的特征值</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"四-dna-的遗传信息\">四、DNA 的遗传信息</h3><p>DNA 中的遗传信息储存在<strong>碱基对的排列顺序</strong>中。四种碱基（A、T、G、C）的不同排列组合可以编码无穷多种遗传信息——正如英文的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span></span></span></span></span> 个字母可以组合成无数单词一样。</p>\n<p>一条 DNA 分子含有数百万到数亿个碱基对。例如人类最长的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 号染色体上的 DNA 含有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 亿个碱基对。</p>\n<p><strong>DNA 的多样性</strong>：碱基对的排列顺序千变万化（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种组合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为碱基对数），这是生物多样性的分子基础。</p>\n<p><strong>DNA 的特异性</strong>：每个物种（甚至每个个体）的 DNA 碱基序列都是独特的，这是 DNA 指纹鉴定的原理基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-dna-的复制\">五、DNA 的复制</h3><p><strong>时间</strong>：细胞分裂间期的 S 期</p>\n<p><strong>场所</strong>：主要在细胞核内（线粒体和叶绿体中也有少量 DNA 复制）</p>\n<p><strong>方式</strong>：<strong>半保留复制</strong>——每个子代 DNA 分子中，一条链来自母链，另一条是新合成的</p>\n<p><strong>过程</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>参与的酶</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解旋</td>\n<td>DNA 双螺旋在解旋酶作用下解开</td>\n<td>解旋酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成</td>\n<td>以解开的每条母链为模板，按碱基互补配对原则，合成新的子链</td>\n<td>DNA 聚合酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接</td>\n<td>新合成的 DNA 片段被连接起来</td>\n<td>DNA 连接酶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>复制的特点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>半保留复制</strong>：保证遗传信息的连续性</li>\n<li><strong>双向复制</strong>：从复制起点向两个方向同时进行</li>\n<li><strong>多起点复制</strong>：真核细胞的 DNA 有多个复制起点，加快复制速度</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>半保留复制的实验证据（梅塞尔森-斯塔尔实验，1958年）</strong>：</p>\n<p>将大肠杆菌在含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>（重氮）的培养基中培养多代，使 DNA 全部标记为重 DNA。然后转入含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>14</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{14}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>（轻氮）的培养基中培养。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代数</th>\n<th>DNA 密度分布</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>亲代</td>\n<td>全重（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>两条链都含重氮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第1代</td>\n<td>全中（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{15}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>14</mn></msup><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{14}\\text{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>半保留复制：一条重链+一条轻链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第2代</td>\n<td>一半中，一半轻</td>\n<td>两个子 DNA 中各保留一条原始链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-dna-复制的精确性\">六、DNA 复制的精确性</h3><p>DNA 复制的错误率极低（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> - <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 每碱基对每次复制），保证了遗传信息的稳定传递。</p>\n<p>精确性来源于：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>碱基互补配对本身的精确性</li>\n<li>DNA 聚合酶的校对功能（发现错误可以切除并重新合成）</li>\n<li>细胞内的 DNA 修复系统</li>\n</ol>\n<p>尽管如此，仍然会有极少数错误不被修正，成为<strong>基因突变</strong>——这是生物进化的原始材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某 DNA 分子中腺嘌呤（A）占碱基总数的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。求鸟嘌呤（G）、胸腺嘧啶（T）和胞嘧啶（C）各占的百分比。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个 DNA 分子有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 个碱基对，其中 A 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> 个。该 DNA 经过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 次复制后：(1) 共有多少个 DNA 分子？(2) 含有母链的 DNA 分子有几个？(3) 共需要多少个游离的胞嘧啶脱氧核苷酸？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>赫尔希和蔡斯为什么用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>32</mn></msup><mtext>P</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{32}\\text{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P</span></span></span></span></span></span> 标记 DNA 而不用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>14</mn></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{14}\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么 DNA 双螺旋中嘌呤总数等于嘧啶总数。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：如果 DNA 复制采用&quot;全保留复制&quot;（两条母链留在一起，两条新链组成另一个 DNA），在梅塞尔森-斯塔尔实验中第一代和第二代的结果会有什么不同？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>DNA 双螺旋结构的发现被认为是20世纪最伟大的科学成就之一。沃森和克里克的成功建立在多位科学家的工作基础上：查加夫发现了碱基等量关系（A=T, G=C），威尔金斯和富兰克林用 X 射线衍射拍摄了 DNA 的&quot;照片51号&quot;，提供了关键的结构数据。遗憾的是，富兰克林在1958年因卵巢癌去世（年仅37岁），未能分享1962年的诺贝尔奖。人类基因组计划在2003年完成了对人类约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 亿个碱基对的完整测序，这一成就使得基因诊断、个性化医疗和基因编辑（如CRISPR-Cas9技术）成为可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DNA 是主要的遗传物质，这一结论由肺炎链球菌转化实验和噬菌体侵染实验共同证明。DNA 由四种脱氧核苷酸组成，两条链通过碱基互补配对（A-T、G-C）形成双螺旋结构。遗传信息储存在碱基对的排列顺序中。DNA 复制采用半保留复制方式：解旋后以每条母链为模板，按碱基互补配对合成新链。半保留复制保证了遗传信息从亲代到子代的精确传递。DNA 聚合酶的校对功能和修复系统进一步保障了复制的准确性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一生物 — DNA结构与复制","id":"高一生物-dna结构与复制"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、DNA 是主要的遗传物质","id":"一-dna-是主要的遗传物质"},{"level":3,"text":"二、DNA 的化学组成","id":"二-dna-的化学组成"},{"level":3,"text":"三、DNA 双螺旋结构","id":"三-dna-双螺旋结构"},{"level":3,"text":"四、DNA 的遗传信息","id":"四-dna-的遗传信息"},{"level":3,"text":"五、DNA 的复制","id":"五-dna-的复制"},{"level":3,"text":"六、DNA 复制的精确性","id":"六-dna-复制的精确性"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一生物 — 孟德尔定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/mendel-laws"},"next":{"title":"高一生物 — 基因表达","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/gene-expression"}}